lmarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T11:41:03-07:00","id":668534,"title":"","content":"Remember: no travel beyond the Lunar sphere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T11:49:55-07:00","id":668551,"title":"","content":"It's an interesting question. Hard to imagine what would represent the Glory of Vacuum, or Absence.<br /> <br /> I have to imagine an invisibility ability would be there somewhere. But light travels through vacuum. I'd suggest the 'you leave no physical trace,' but that's already taken up elsewhere. I think you'd want to be more specific about exactly what spirit is being hunted and offering its gifts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-17-2015, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:05:23-07:00","id":668782,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/667775-what-kind-of-gift-would-void-or-vacuum-be-like?p=668534#post668534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember: no travel beyond the Lunar sphere.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is being over ridden because the original post states I want an outer space themed adventure. Ergo, I have to forgo that rule wntirely.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Also No father, I'm not even sure myself on want field should this encompas. Hence why I am asking a forum instead of posting a homebrew. I lack creativity on this subject.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:10:02-07:00","id":668783,"title":"","content":"Cunning can be some sort of speed of light dash thing. Not sure if that's thematic or not. Some way to travel through the void without needing a vessel. Maybe just the ability to move through the void (x distance) a number of times reflexively per turn equal to Cunning renown. Otherwise you're just floating helplessly.<br /> <br /> Glory. Some sort of touch of void thing maybe. This is the one I'm having the most trouble with.<br /> <br /> Honor is the one that allows you to resist the effects of space for a number of (hours? days?) equal to Honor renown. Oxygen deprivation, ebullism, radiation, extreme temperatures, etc.<br /> <br /> Purity might be some way to derive low levels of essence from the electromagnetic radiation, cosmic rays or perhaps the magnetic fields of planetary bodies (to keep one from just exploring deep space forever). Maybe something involving other moons, though how or why that would work (or any of this) is beyond me. Still, you'd need a way to acquire essence in space, unless all these gifts were made to use none, and even still.<br /> <br /> Wisdom could perhaps be an ability to see/sense living or ephemeral entities through the void over long distances. Along with some kind of compass/direction sense Otherwise you'll just be travelling forever through the abyss with no chance of encountering anything or anyone.<br /> <br /> Naturally the gifts are offered by a Moonbound (formerly) Idigam. I forget if there are rules against Idigam gifts, but there probably are so this particular Idigam idea is probably moot. This is mostly unchartered territory anyway. I'm not sure what the rules of space and Shadow space are. I was sort of operating under the idea of spending longer periods in space, and not necessarily just brief forays, so these may or may not be anything like what you were thinking of.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 09-17-2015, 06:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:11:07-07:00","id":668785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Almarck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/667775-what-kind-of-gift-would-void-or-vacuum-be-like?p=668782#post668782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also No father, I'm not even sure myself on want field should this encompas. Hence why I am asking a forum instead of posting a homebrew. I lack creativity on this subject.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's just what I mean, space and the vacuum of it is probably a mixture of different things rather than one individual thing, Space, Light, Solar Wind and Radiation. Or alternatively one thing that is more specific than Vacuum, which in this case is just an inversion of elements, specifically a lack of Air and Earth and Water.<br /> <br /> For just surviving out in space, provided you weren't planning on doing it long term, you might be able to get by with the Elemental Gift of air.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 09-17-2015, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link"